.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.key
secrets/
clients/*
# Exception: Powerhouse Roofing public website is tracked + deployed (data/scripts stay ignored)
!clients/powerhouse-roofing
clients/powerhouse-roofing/*
!clients/powerhouse-roofing/website
# Exception: estimator/proposal tool, published to GitHub Pages.
# NOTE: this folder contains material costs, labor rates and margin structure.
# It is publicly readable at kimballmueller.github.io. Published knowingly.
!clients/powerhouse-roofing/deliverables
clients/powerhouse-roofing/deliverables/*
!clients/powerhouse-roofing/deliverables/proposal-maker

# Exception: Sublime Personnel. Whole client folder is tracked and PUBLIC.
# NOTE: this includes design/README.md, which carries internal notes — SOW clause
# references, a quote from the discovery transcript, and open questions for Pete.
# Published knowingly.
!clients/sublime-personnel
# ...but NOT pending/. That folder holds copy drafted from things clients said
# off the record — Pete named healthcare clients on the Aug 28 call prefaced with
# "between me and you", and Sublime never publishes client names because
# candidates use them to apply direct. Drafts go to Pete by email, not by URL.
clients/sublime-personnel/pending/


# Fireflies transcript dumps (raw call audio text)
transcripts/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
